Package: ukbcareer
Title: Lifetime Work-History Attributes for UK Biobank via a Frozen Transformer
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Jie", family = "Zhang",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "changchieh1998@163.com")
Author: Jie Zhang [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jie Zhang <changchieh1998@163.com>
Description: Derives career attributes from UK Biobank Category 130 lifetime
    occupational histories. Tier 0 needs nothing but the raw CSV and gives a
    clean event table, an annual panel, nine-state annual sequences, exposure
    summaries and CAMSIS occupational status. Tier 1 adds occupational mobility
    geometry from a distributed 353-by-192 code embedding. Tier 2 adds the
    frozen 192-dimensional representation and a career typology obtained by
    re-running the published clustering recipe on the user's own sample.
    All definitions match the published pipeline, so estimates are comparable
    across studies. No health outcomes are involved: the package produces
    exposures, not results.
